 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "最难发现的篡改，只对一个目标生效。",
   "spoken": "最难发现的篡改，只对一个目标生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.579
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 5.02,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 5.02,
   "speechEnd": 10.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "FBI 公告把它归因于朝鲜。",
   "spoken": "FBI 公告把它归因于朝鲜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 10.68,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 10.777,
   "speechEnd": 13.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "Safe 的初步报告称，2 月 4 日，一名开发者的电脑失陷。",
   "spoken": "Safe 的初步报告称，2 月 4 日，一名开发者的电脑失陷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 13.54,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 13.54,
   "speechEnd": 17.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "起因是运行了一个受污染的 Docker 项目。",
   "spoken": "起因是运行了一个受污染的 Docker 项目。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 18.4,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 18.496,
   "speechEnd": 21.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "攻击者没能注册自己的验证设备，就劫持了活跃的 AWS 会话令牌。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没能注册自己的验证设备，就劫持了活跃的 AWS 会话令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 21.9,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 21.991,
   "speechEnd": 27.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "然后，篡改了 S3 上 Safe 网页前端的脚本。",
   "spoken": "然后，篡改了 S3 上 Safe 网页前端的脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 27.88,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 27.977,
   "speechEnd": 31.194
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "脚本先判断，发起交易的是不是 Bybit 的多签地址。",
   "spoken": "脚本先判断，发起交易的是不是 Bybit 的多签地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 31.62,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 31.62,
   "speechEnd": 35.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "不是，就一切正常。",
   "spoken": "不是，就一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 35.92,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 36.015,
   "speechEnd": 37.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "是，界面照样显示一笔正常转账，实际构造的是一次 DELEGATECALL。",
   "spoken": "是，界面照样显示一笔正常转账，实际构造的是一次 DELEGATECALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 37.98,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 37.98,
   "speechEnd": 43.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "签名人在硬件钱包上签名，只看到一串哈希。",
   "spoken": "签名人在硬件钱包上签名，只看到一串哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 43.56,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 43.56,
   "speechEnd": 47.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "签名凑够门槛，交易执行，多签的实现合约被替换。",
   "spoken": "签名凑够门槛，交易执行，多签的实现合约被替换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 47.7,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 47.802,
   "speechEnd": 53.634
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "约 40 万枚 ETH 类资产被转走，约 2 分钟后，脚本被换回干净版本。",
   "spoken": "约 40 万枚 ETH 类资产被转走，约 2 分钟后，脚本被换回干净版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 54.08,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 54.173,
   "speechEnd": 59.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "外部研究者打开页面，看到的一切正常。",
   "spoken": "外部研究者打开页面，看到的一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 59.9,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 59.9,
   "speechEnd": 63.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "Verichains 称，恶意代码只在特定条件下激活。",
   "spoken": "Verichains 称，恶意代码只在特定条件下激活。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 63.56,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 63.657,
   "speechEnd": 67.372
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "Sygnia 认为，Safe 的云存储账号或密钥很可能泄露。",
   "spoken": "Sygnia 认为，Safe 的云存储账号或密钥很可能泄露。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 67.78,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 67.872,
   "speechEnd": 71.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "在 Bybit 自己的系统里，没有发现入侵证据，Safe 称合约不受影响。",
   "spoken": "在 Bybit 自己的系统里，没有发现入侵证据，Safe 称合约不受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 72.32,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 72.32,
   "speechEnd": 77.718
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "关键在这里。",
   "spoken": "关键在这里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 78.14,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 78.23,
   "speechEnd": 79.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "所有签名人都用同一个网页前端，前端就是这个多签的单点。",
   "spoken": "所有签名人都用同一个网页前端，前端就是这个多签的单点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 79.88,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 79.88,
   "speechEnd": 84.931
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "增加签名人，无法解决这个问题。",
   "spoken": "增加签名人，无法解决这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 85.38,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 85.38,
   "speechEnd": 88.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "防线在签名这一步，签名人用独立工具，重新计算交易哈希，在硬件钱包上核对。",
   "spoken": "防线在签名这一步，签名人用独立工具，重新计算交易哈希，在硬件钱包上核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 88.56,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 88.56,
   "speechEnd": 95.87
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "例行转账只允许普通调用，委托调用进单独的审批流程。",
   "spoken": "例行转账只允许普通掉用，委托掉用进单独的审批流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-21.wav",
   "start": 96.3,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 96.397,
   "speechEnd": 101.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "发布方用独立系统，比对线上文件和构建产物的哈希。",
   "spoken": "发布方用独立系统，比对线上文件和构建产物的哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-22.wav",
   "start": 101.48,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 101.57,
   "speechEnd": 106.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "但比对只覆盖那一刻、那个位置，要在多个位置反复比对，并保留每个版本的哈希和访问日志。",
   "spoken": "但比对只覆盖那一刻、那个位置，要在多个位置反复比对，并保留每个版本的哈希和访问日志。",
